{title: Tum Dil Ki Dhadkan Me}
{artist: Abhijeet Kumar Sanu Nadeem Shravan}
{key: F}

{c: Verse 1}
[F]Tum dil [G]ki dhadkan mein
[Em]rehte ho, [F]tum rehte ho
[F]Meri in [G]saanson se
[Em]kehte ho, [F]kehte ho
[F]Baahon [G]mein aajao,
[Am]sapnon [F]mein khojaao
[F]Hey, [Am]hey, [C]hey, [Am]aa,haa,haaheyhey [F]
[F]Deewano sa [Em]haal hua,
[G]humko unse [F]pyaar hua
[F]Dheere se [Em]voh paas aaye,
[G]chupke se [F]izhaar hua
[F]Ab naa [G]kisise darna hai,
[Em]sang jeena [F]marna hai
[F]Baahon [G]mein aajao,
[Am]sapnon [F]mein khojaao
[F]Duniyaa Ne [Em]Thukraaaya He
[G]Bus Tumnee [F]Apnaaya Hai
[F]Dil Koo [Em]Kitnaa Chain Mila
[G]Sub Neeee [F]Itna Sataaaya Hai
[F]Apna Haaaaai [G]Ik Sapnaa
[Em]Ik Tu [F]Hiiiii Hoo Apna
